1
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,479
Drop the knife!

2
00:01:16,439 --> 00:01:17,760
Call the police!

3
00:01:21,719 --> 00:01:23,200
How did you know my home address?

4
00:01:23,959 --> 00:01:25,640
Shouldn't you thank me first?

5
00:01:26,879 --> 00:01:28,480
Why suspect me instead?

6
00:01:31,799 --> 00:01:34,159
Even if I really wanted this job,

7
00:01:34,799 --> 00:01:36,120
I'd never resort to

8
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:38,040
such dirty tricks.

9
00:01:44,599 --> 00:01:46,640
Then you should definitely explain

10
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:50,400
how you found my place.

11
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:52,799
As for your address,

12
00:01:53,079 --> 00:01:54,840
the person who recommended me gave it to me.

13
00:01:55,519 --> 00:01:56,799
I came to your place today

14
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:57,760
just to let you know,

15
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,200
so it wouldn't delay

16
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,000
tomorrow's work.

17
00:02:03,719 --> 00:02:05,400
Professor Han sent you to find me?

18
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:07,480
Huh?

19
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,719
The renowned psychology expert

20
00:02:10,719 --> 00:02:12,520
and university professor—

21
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,439
since when is Mr. Chen Yanzhi's last name Han?

22
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:18,280
Why didn't you tell me from the start

23
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,680
that Professor Chen recommended you?

24
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,960
Didn't I kindly

25
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,560
give all the other applicants a heads-up?

26
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,919
I couldn't just yell out loud,

27
00:02:27,919 --> 00:02:28,680
"Hey,

28
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,240
I'm pulling strings

29
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,039
through Professor Chen," could I?

30
00:02:36,479 --> 00:02:37,680
You really make yourself at home.

31
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:40,960
A man and a woman alone in a room—

32
00:02:41,759 --> 00:02:43,319
being too polite would just make it awkward.

33
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,039
I haven't agreed to hire you yet.

34
00:02:46,319 --> 00:02:47,479
Professor Chen said

35
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,159
that with my skills,

36
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,360
I'd be the best candidate for your assistant.

37
00:02:53,719 --> 00:02:54,840
You do have some skills.

38
00:02:57,879 --> 00:02:59,000
Pretty good moves.

39
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,479
Pretty thick-skinned, too.

40
00:03:03,319 --> 00:03:04,319
And your pants—

41
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,080
can you pull them up a bit?

42
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:11,080
It's tying up that pervert outside.

43
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,719
How about lending me a pair of yours

44
00:03:14,319 --> 00:03:15,360
to make do for now?

45
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:24,479
I heard it was murder.

46
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,159
What a tragedy!

47
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,960
Even the prosecutor investigating the case was killed.

48
00:03:29,159 --> 00:03:30,039
Why do you think the main family

49
00:03:30,039 --> 00:03:32,479
secretly sent Young Master Shen away?

50
00:03:33,159 --> 00:03:35,639
The one who died this time was an illegitimate son.

51
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:39,560
What if something happens to the heir?

52
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,759
Brother, wait for me to come back.

53
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,639
I will avenge you.

54
00:03:58,639 --> 00:03:59,560
Mom...

55
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:01,560
I'll definitely find the killer

56
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,039
and avenge you.

57
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,079
Gu Yan,

58
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:39,319
long time no see.

59
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:40,879
This time,

60
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,439
I'll search for the truth with you.

61
00:04:50,439 --> 00:04:51,040
Don't move!

62
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,079
Are you two all right?

63
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,040
We're fine.

64
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:54,879
This is

65
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,680
my new assistant, Shen Yu.

66
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:58,639
When the assailant attacked me,

67
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,959
he was the one who subdued him.

68
00:05:00,879 --> 00:05:01,879
Impressive moves.

69
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,680
Let's talk about the rest later.

70
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:06,000
Come back to the station to give a police statement.

71
00:05:06,959 --> 00:05:07,639
Move it.

72
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,360
It wasn't me!

73
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,800
It wasn't me!

74
00:05:16,959 --> 00:05:17,600
Yan,

75
00:05:17,879 --> 00:05:19,720
thank you for giving your police statement.

76
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:20,920
No problem.

77
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,759
From our interrogation of Zhang Dafeng,

78
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:26,839
we can currently confirm

79
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:29,040
that he's the culprit in the two previous murders.

80
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:30,639
He only finished elementary school,

81
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:31,920
and his IQ

82
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:32,680
is between 85

83
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,639
and 115,

84
00:05:33,959 --> 00:05:35,439
which falls into the average range.

85
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:36,680
He doesn't match

86
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,160
the serial killer's

87
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:39,279
criminal psychological profile from back then.

88
00:05:39,879 --> 00:05:41,120
We also found out

89
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:42,560
that Zhang Dafeng's parents divorced when he was young.

90
00:05:43,199 --> 00:05:44,040
He grew up with a father

91
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:46,079
who was an alcoholic and abusive.

92
00:05:46,639 --> 00:05:48,279
At 16, working on a construction site,

93
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,439
he was sexually assaulted by two middle-aged men,

94
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,680
which led to sexual dysfunction.

95
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:55,199
He has a horrific,

96
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,360
unspeakable history of childhood abuse.

97
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,839
How is his mental state?

98
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,920
Extremely unstable.

99
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,399
Did you ask

100
00:06:03,399 --> 00:06:04,399
why he placed coins

101
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:05,279
in the victims' hands?

102
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:08,680
His interrogation is still ongoing.

103
00:06:09,199 --> 00:06:10,680
If you want to know more,

104
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,600
you'll have to wait a bit.

105
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:14,319
All right.

106
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,720
It's getting late.

107
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,439
Go home and get some rest.

108
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,759
Lu Yuan,

109
00:06:22,759 --> 00:06:24,639
is there something else you want to tell me?

110
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,600
Gu Yan,

111
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,600
do you know Shen Yu's true identity?

112
00:06:31,639 --> 00:06:32,600
After all,

113
00:06:32,839 --> 00:06:34,839
he'll be working beside you every day.

114
00:06:35,439 --> 00:06:36,720
Professor Chen recommended him.

115
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:39,120
Since I decided to hire him,

116
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,040
I trust him completely.

117
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,439
Besides,

118
00:06:43,839 --> 00:06:45,120
given my current situation,

119
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,639
I need someone physically capable,

120
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,680
who can handle all my errands

121
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,959
and manage crises.

122
00:06:51,759 --> 00:06:52,519
All right.

123
00:06:52,839 --> 00:06:54,240
As long as you've made up your mind.

124
00:07:03,079 --> 00:07:04,360
What a coincidence.

125
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:06,399
I've been waiting for you for over half an hour.

126
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:11,879
I'll get going now.

127
00:07:13,279 --> 00:07:13,800
Okay.

128
00:07:14,199 --> 00:07:15,600
Take care of yourself.

129
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,079
Captain,

130
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,959
