Shen Yu was abroad all this time.

135
00:07:39,279 --> 00:07:40,600
The minute he got back,

136
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:42,079
he came to the station

137
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,600
to ask about that old serial murder case.

138
00:07:45,319 --> 00:07:47,079
And right after that, 13 years later,

139
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,600
that kind of coin

140
00:07:49,279 --> 00:07:50,040
showed up again in the hands

141
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,680
of the victim killed by Zhang Dafeng.

142
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:55,120
Could all this really be a coincidence?

143
00:08:03,399 --> 00:08:04,199
Uh...

144
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:06,879
It's pretty safe at home, right?

145
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,120
All by yourself...

146
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,000
