147
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:12,319
I mean,

148
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,439
with everything that happened today,

149
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,480
aren't you...

150
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:19,199
scared?

151
00:08:20,839 --> 00:08:21,639
So?

152
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,759
So...

153
00:08:24,639 --> 00:08:26,120
uh, do you need me

154
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:28,519
to stay and keep you company?

155
00:08:28,839 --> 00:08:29,800
Hey, I mean,

156
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:32,360
as long as you promise not to try anything.

157
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:34,360
Get out.

158
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:35,759
Hey!

159
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,320
I...

160
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:51,840
Even though

161
00:08:52,799 --> 00:08:55,240
I perfectly match Zhang Dafeng's target profile,

162
00:08:55,559 --> 00:08:56,720
was it really just a coincidence

163
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:58,879
