167
00:09:06,399 --> 00:09:08,799
A criminal coming specifically for me.

168
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,360
Hey, Gu Yan.

169
00:09:10,519 --> 00:09:11,240
Something big happened.

170
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,919
A pregnant woman died in Hong'an Community.
